  "descriptionGet": "✋ ConstraintError: --pr is absent, and branch 'surf/no-pull-here' has no open pull on ehmpathy/surf-demo

🥥 did you know?
   └─ to fix it, pick one
      ├─ rhx git.commit.push --mode apply   # if this branch has no pull yet, a push opens one
      └─ rhx git.pull.description.get --pr <n> ...   # or name a pull, closed or merged included
",
  "descriptionSet": "✋ ConstraintError: --pr is absent, and branch 'surf/no-pull-here' has no open pull on ehmpathy/surf-demo

🥥 did you know?
